            "line": 366,
            "text": "theorem axial_divergence (P : Patch) {F : ℝ × E → ℝ}\n    (hF : ContDiff ℝ ∞ F) (hs : RadialAlias.RadiallySupported P.a P.b F) (p : E) {r : ℝ} (hr : 0 < r) :\n    IntegratedMeanBalances.radialDivergence 1 (fun t => sigma P 1 F (t, p)) r =\n      -adjusted P 1 F (r, p)"
